From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: feder-cr <85809106+feder-cr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 09:34:39 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] test(naga): Update SPIR-V snapshots for the picked spv-out
 refactors

These outputs were not regenerated when the spv-out refactors were picked
(the WGSL snapshot test panicked on texture-external-argument before
reaching them). The changes are id renumbering only, plus `OpName`s for
the parameters of wrapped helper functions in access, mat_cx2 and
mat_cx2_f16; they are identical to what the unfixed branch generates.
---
